# The thinking map of the claude-code AgentHarness (docs/adr/0040 §2,
# 0041 §1): what a role's THINKING (low|medium|high, plan §5) becomes.
# Read by adapters/claude-code/run.sh; a missing line is a refusal
# naming this file and the key.
#
# Claude Code 2.1.311: --effort low|medium|high|xhigh|max (`claude
# --help`), sent to the Messages API as output_config.effort with
# thinking {type: adaptive} (verified against a scripted endpoint,
# 2026-11-04). The same three words; ADR 0040's ADK map sends Claude the
# same effort values.
ANTHROPIC_LOW=low
ANTHROPIC_MEDIUM=medium
ANTHROPIC_HIGH=high
